{"id":"624178","name":"糯米豆包","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/624178/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红豆","amount":"280g"},{"name":"黑米","amount":"150g"},{"name":"糯米","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"红糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葡萄干","amount":"适量"},{"name":"粘米粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"饺子皮","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红豆浸泡一夜。","img":"images/624178/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黑米糯米洗净，浸泡4小时。","img":"images/624178/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红豆，黑米，糯米，放适量水，按煮饭键。","img":"images/624178/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"适量红枣，葡萄干切小丁。","img":"images/624178/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮出的红豆饭，放适量红糖搅拌。","img":"images/624178/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"继续放红枣葡萄干丁搅拌。","img":"images/624178/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放一大勺面粉，一大勺粘米粉搅拌。（增加稳定性）","img":"images/624178/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"饺子皮，用擀面杖擀大擀薄。","img":"images/624178/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅匀的红豆饭揉成适量圆形。","img":"images/624178/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包入饺子皮内，用虎口捏出烧卖的外形。","img":"images/624178/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开放入蒸锅里。","img":"images/624178/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蒸10分钟即可。","img":"images/624178/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}